<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - LEHMAN PICKS EURO STOCKS FOR 1997.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LEHMAN PICKS EURO STOCKS FOR 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategists at Lehman Brothers on Wednesday named eight continental European stocks they expect to outperform through 1997, as part of a pan-European list of 19 stocks they favour for the year.</p>
</text>
